    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Key Insights'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='860' maxwidth='650' minheight='560' minwidth='420' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='32173' id='3' type-v2='text' w='97538' x='1231' y='1159'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='20'>Key Insights</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='65509' id='5' type-v2='text' w='48769' x='1231' y='33332'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run>* The number of active users was approximately the same across all continents, but the vast majority of actual purchases came from the Americas. 
**This suggests that users from outside the Americas are viewing the store but very few of them are actually making purchases on it. 

* Of over 900K views on items, only around 50K led to items being carted and only around 11.5K led to items being purchased. This means that our biggest bottleneck on purchases is the stage from items being viewed to being put in the cart.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='65509' id='6' type-v2='text' w='48769' x='50000' y='33332'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run>* Most of the revenue (Approx. $1.2M) came from direct traffic with around $230K coming from Google, $77K from DFA, and less coming from all the other sources combined. We could prioritize these 3 sources for our revenue or focus on building a stronger presence with other sources that are not our most profitable sources, like Bing or Yahoo.

* The vast majority of revenue (≈ 98.35%) did not come from a campaign at all, so perhaps campaigns are not worth pursuing</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
